m/users/jobfynder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created":false,"deleted":false,"base_ref":null,"compare":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/compare/e4cf43211b64...c53182540026","commits":[{"id":"c5318254002692afd2fe70ec2987bb8e2ff66517","tree_id":"c21ebda4a144b1e2e93171e07593d6ebd4d4342f","distinct":true,"message":"feat(taxonomy): bulk approve/reject for the taxonomy candidate queue\n\n294 pending skill candidates and 60 pending job titles have piled up\nsince HERMES-900 shipped -- approving/rejecting them one row at a time\nwas never going to scale. Adds bulk actions on top of the existing\nper-candidate approve/reject, nothing about the single-row flow changes.\n\nbulk_approve_taxonomy_candidates / bulk_reject_taxonomy_candidates\n(app/understanding/taxonomy/candidates.py) loop over the existing\nsingle-candidate functions -- same description generation, same\nAI-overwrite protection, same audit trail per candidate -- and never\nlet one bad id (already reviewed by someone else in the meantime) stop\nthe rest of the batch; failures are reported back per id instead.\nNew endpoints POST /taxonomy-candidates/bulk-approve and\n.../bulk-reject.\n\nReview page: each row gets a checkbox, a header checkbox selects/\nclears all, and an \"Approve selected\" / \"Reject selected\" bar appears\nonce anything's checked. Also added a Type column (Skill vs Job title)\nto the table -- it was already in the data, just never surfaced.\n\nNew coverage: a bulk approve puts every candidate live in the taxonomy\nimmediately; a bulk reject keeps every one of them out; a batch with\none nonexistent id still approves the valid ones and reports the bad\none instead of raising. Full regression suite (18 checks) green\nagainst a fresh schema and rebuilt image; frontend type-checks and\nbuilds clean.","timestamp":"2026-08-31T10:57:42-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/commit/c5318254002692afd2fe70ec2987bb8e2ff66517","author":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-31T10:57:42-04:00"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-31T10:57:42-04:00"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["app/routers/moderation.py","app/understanding/taxonomy/candidates.py","frontend/src/api/client.ts","frontend/src/pages/ModerationPage.tsx","scripts/hermes-900-spam-taxonomy-check.py"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"c5318254002692afd2fe70ec2987bb8e2ff66517","tree_id":"c21ebda4a144b1e2e93171e07593d6ebd4d4342f","distinct":true,"message":"feat(taxonomy): bulk approve/reject for the taxonomy candidate queue\n\n294 pending skill candidates and 60 pending job titles have piled up\nsince HERMES-900 shipped -- approving/rejecting them one row at a time\nwas never going to scale. Adds bulk actions on top of the existing\nper-candidate approve/reject, nothing about the single-row flow changes.\n\nbulk_approve_taxonomy_candidates / bulk_reject_taxonomy_candidates\n(app/understanding/taxonomy/candidates.py) loop over the existing\nsingle-candidate functions -- same description generation, same\nAI-overwrite protection, same audit trail per candidate -- and never\nlet one bad id (already reviewed by someone else in the meantime) stop\nthe rest of the batch; failures are reported back per id instead.\nNew endpoints POST /taxonomy-candidates/bulk-approve and\n.../bulk-reject.\n\nReview page: each row gets a checkbox, a header checkbox selects/\nclears all, and an \"Approve selected\" / \"Reject selected\" bar appears\nonce anything's checked. Also added a Type column (Skill vs Job title)\nto the table -- it was already in the data, just never surfaced.\n\nNew coverage: a bulk approve puts every candidate live in the taxonomy\nimmediately; a bulk reject keeps every one of them out; a batch with\none nonexistent id still approves the valid ones and reports the bad\none instead of raising. Full regression suite (18 checks) green\nagainst a fresh schema and rebuilt image; frontend type-checks and\nbuilds clean.","timestamp":"2026-08-31T10:57:42-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/commit/c5318254002692afd2fe70ec2987bb8e2ff66517","author":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-31T10:57:42-04:00"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-31T10:57:42-04:00"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["app/routers/moderation.py","app/understanding/taxonomy/candidates.py","frontend/src/api/client.ts","frontend/src/pages/ModerationPage.tsx","scripts/hermes-900-spam-taxonomy-check.py"]}}
